    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.25Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of February 17, 2006\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 13th February, 2006]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nMERCHANT SHIPPING (CHANGE OFDESIGNATION) ACT, No. 3 OF 2006\n\nMerchant Shipping (Change of Designation)Act, No. 3 of 20061\n\n[Certified on 13th February , 2006]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 35/2005.\n\nAN ACT TO CHANGE THE DESIGNATION OF THE DIRECTOR OF MERCHANTSHIPPING AND TO MAKE SUCH AMENDMENTS IN WRITTEN LAW AS ARE CONSEQUENTIAL.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Merchant Shipping(Change of Designation) Act, No. 3 of 2006.\n\n2.With effect from the date of commencement of thisAct, in every context in which \u201cDirector of Merchantshipping\u201d appears in\u2014\n\n(a) subsection (1) of section 3 and elsewhere inthe Merchant Shipping Act, No. 52 of 1971and in any other written law; and\n\n(b) any notice, communication, or otherdocument issued, made, required orauthorized by or under any written law,\n\nthere shall be substituted for the words \u201cDirector of MerchantShipping\u201d, the words \u201cDirector-General of MerchantShipping\u201d.\n\n3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendment tosection 3 of theMerchantShipping Act, No.52 of 1971.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\nMerchant Shipping (Change of Designation)Act, No. 3 of 20062"
