    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 9.50 Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of August 12, 2005\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 8th August, 2005]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nFINANCE LEASING (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 24 OF 2005\n\nFinance Leasing (Amendment) Act, No. 24 of 20051\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 8th August, 2005]\n\nL. D. \u2014 O. 31/2004.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE FINANCE LEASING ACT, NO. 56 OF 2000\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Finance Leasing(Amendment) Act, No. 24 of 2005\n\n2.Section 4 of the Finance Leasing Act, No. 56 of 2000(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended in paragraph (c) of subsection (1) of that section, bythe substitution for the words \u201ccase of a public company\u2014\u201d,of the words and figures \u201ccase of a public company, otherthan those referred to in paragraph (a) and (b) ofsection 3 \u2014\u201d\n\n3.Section 21 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in paragraph (b) of subsection (1) of that section,by the substitution, for the words \u201ctwenty one days\u201d of thewords \u201cseven days\u201d.\n\n4.Section 24 of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed and the following section substituted therefor :\u2014\n\n24. (1) A lessor may, with the written consentof the lessee obtained at the time of enteringinto the finance lease or thereafter, transfer orassign all or any of the lessor\u2019s rights under thefinance lease or in relation to any equipmentprovided under the lease or of both, to anyregistered establishment or to any specialpurpose vehicle :"
